== dac query --help
NAME:
   dac query - Run a SQL query against a connection

USAGE:
   dac query [options]

OPTIONS:
   --connection string, -c string  Connection name from .bruin.yml
   --file string, -f string        Path to a .sql file to execute
   --dir string, -d string         Dashboard definitions directory (default: ".")
   --dashboard string              Dashboard name (to run a specific widget's query)
   --widget string, -w string      Widget name within the dashboard
   --output string, -o string      Output format: table, json, csv (default: "table")
   --help, -h                      show help

GLOBAL OPTIONS:
   --config string, -c string       Path to .bruin.yml config file (default: auto-discover)
   --environment string, -e string  Target environment name
   --debug                          Enable debug logging
