OPTIONS:
   --dashboard string, -n string  Dashboard name (required)
   --credentials string           Path to Google OAuth credentials.json (default: gcloud ADC)
   --dir string, -d string        Dashboard definitions directory (default: ".")
   --filters string               JSON string with filter overrides
   --help, -h                     show help

GLOBAL OPTIONS:
   --config string, -c string       Path to .bruin.yml config file (default: auto-discover)
   --environment string, -e string  Target environment name
   --debug                          Enable debug logging
== dac upgrade --help
NAME:
   dac upgrade - Upgrade the dac CLI in place to the latest release

USAGE:
   dac upgrade [options] [tag]

DESCRIPTION:
   Re-runs the official install script to replace the current binary with the latest release on the same channel. Pass --channel edge to track the edge stream, or a tag like v1.2.3 as an argument to pin to a specific version.

OPTIONS:
   --channel string  Release channel to install from (stable or edge)
   --bindir string   Directory to install into (default: directory of the current binary)
   --help, -h        show help

GLOBAL OPTIONS:
   --config string, -c string       Path to .bruin.yml config file (default: auto-discover)
   --environment string, -e string  Target environment name
   --debug                          Enable debug logging
